      "name": "Season 2",
      "overview": "Picking up from the shocking season one finale, Maddie works to bring a doubting Simon—her only connection to the living world—back on board to help her track down and collect her missing body. Stuck in the afterlife with the knowledge of what happened to her, Maddie must unite her friends in the spectral and living worlds in order to reclaim her stolen life.",
